<Window x:Class="WpfApp_FlexT.MainWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
        xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
        xmlns:local="clr-namespace:WpfApp_FlexT"
        mc:Ignorable="d"
        xmlns:qpanel="clr-namespace:QSoft.WPF.Panel;assembly=QSoft.WPF.Panel"
        xmlns:webview="clr-namespace:Microsoft.Web.WebView2.Wpf;assembly=Microsoft.Web.WebView2.Wpf"
        Title="MainWindow" Height="770" Width="900">
    <Grid>
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <!-- Selection area. There are too many test cases for one list, so they are narrowed down first: by category (the
             part of the file name before its first "_") and by search keywords, which the search box suggests while they
             are typed. The ComboBox lists what is left, and the settings of the chosen test case are shown below it twice:
             as ComboBoxes/TextBoxes for those of the panel (Direction, Wrap, Gap, Padding, ...), and as editable JSON (the
             same shape as the TestCase\*.json files), which also holds the settings of every item. Changing either one
             re-renders both sides live and brings the other one up to date (see MainWindow.xaml.cs's
             ApplyPropertyControls and ContentEditTimer_Tick), but nothing is ever written back to the file, so switching
             test cases (or reloading) always reverts to what is on disk.
             The content area has a fixed height (longer JSON text scrolls) for the same reason as the result list below: a
             change of height would resize the two panes, which would leave the web page laid out in a viewport that no
             longer matches the WPF one. The window Height includes this area, so when the area gets another height the
             window needs the same change to leave the panes the size they have now (429 x 326). -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="4,2">
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="200"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <Grid.Resources>
                <Style x:Key="FieldLabel" TargetType="TextBlock">
                    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2,0,8,0"/>
                </Style>
                <!-- A suggestion under the search box. It cannot take the keyboard focus, so a click leaves the focus in the box,
                     and the picked one is highlighted although the list never has the focus. -->
                <Style x:Key="SuggestionItemStyle" TargetType="ListBoxItem">
                    <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False"/>
                    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="6,2"/>
                    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
                    <Setter Property="Template">
                        <Setter.Value>
                            <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem">
                                <Border x:Name="Bd" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}" Background="Transparent">
                                    <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}"/>
                                </Border>
                                <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                                    <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                                        <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E5F3FF"/>
                                    </Trigger>
                                    <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True">
                                        <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#CCE8FF"/>
                                    </Trigger>
                                </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                            </ControlTemplate>
                        </Setter.Value>
                    </Setter>
                </Style>
            </Grid.Resources>

            <TextBlock Text="分類" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}"/>
            <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_category" Grid.Column="1" DisplayMemberPath="DisplayName"
                      Margin="2" Padding="4,3" SelectionChanged="combobox_category_SelectionChanged"/>
            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="搜尋" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" Margin="10,0,8,0"/>
            <Grid Grid.Column="3" Margin="2">
                <TextBox x:Name="textbox_search" Padding="2,3" VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                         GotKeyboardFocus="textbox_search_GotKeyboardFocus" LostKeyboardFocus="textbox_search_LostKeyboardFocus"
                         PreviewKeyDown="textbox_search_PreviewKeyDown" SelectionChanged="textbox_search_SelectionChanged"
                         AutomationProperties.Name="搜尋" TextChanged="textbox_search_TextChanged"/>
                <TextBlock Text="輸入關鍵字篩選 (例: Column SpaceAround)" Foreground="Gray" Margin="6,0"
                           VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
                    <TextBlock.Style>
                        <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/>
                            <Style.Triggers>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Text, ElementName=textbox_search}" Value="">
                                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                            </Style.Triggers>
                        </Style>
                    </TextBlock.Style>
                </TextBlock>
                <!-- The suggestions for the word being typed. A popup, so that the list can cover the web view (a window of its
                     own, which hides any element drawn over it) and does not change the size of the selection area. The list
                     is some dozens of rows at most, so none of them is virtualized: every row exists for UI Automation. -->
                <Popup x:Name="popup_suggestions" PlacementTarget="{Binding ElementName=textbox_search}" Placement="Bottom"
                       StaysOpen="True">
                    <Border Width="{Binding ActualWidth, ElementName=textbox_search}" BorderThickness="1"
                            Background="{DynamicResource {x:Static SystemColors.WindowBrushKey}}"
                            BorderBrush="{DynamicResource {x:Static SystemColors.ControlDarkBrushKey}}">
                        <ListBox x:Name="listbox_suggestions" MaxHeight="240" BorderThickness="0" Focusable="False"
                                 ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="False"
                                 AutomationProperties.Name="搜尋建議"
                                 ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SuggestionItemStyle}"
                                 PreviewMouseLeftButtonDown="listbox_suggestions_PreviewMouseLeftButtonDown">
                            <ListBox.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <Grid>
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}"/>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Count, StringFormat={}{0} 筆}" Foreground="Gray" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                                    </Grid>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ListBox.ItemTemplate>
                        </ListBox>
                    </Border>
                </Popup>
            </Grid>
            <TextBlock x:Name="textblock_count" Grid.Column="4" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" Margin="8,0,2,0"/>

            <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Text="測試案例" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}"/>
            <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_testcase" Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="3" DisplayMemberPath="DisplayName"
                      Margin="2" Padding="4,3" SelectionChanged="combobox_testcase_SelectionChanged"/>
            <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="4" Orientation="Horizontal">
                <Button x:Name="button_prev" Content="上一個" Margin="2" Padding="10,3" Click="button_prev_Click"/>
                <Button x:Name="button_next" Content="下一個" Margin="2" Padding="10,3" Click="button_next_Click"/>
                <Button x:Name="button_recompare" Content="重新比對" Margin="2" Padding="10,3" Click="button_recompare_Click"/>
            </StackPanel>

            <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Text="內容" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="2,6,8,0"/>
            <Grid Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <!-- The settings of the panel. They stay disabled until a test case is shown. A ComboBox or a CheckBox applies
                     its change at once, a number box after a short typing pause (a number that is not valid or below 0 tints
                     the box and is not applied). An empty RowGap/ColumnGap is null: the same as Gap. -->
                <Grid x:Name="grid_properties" IsEnabled="False" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,4,0">
                    <Grid.Resources>
                        <Style x:Key="PropertyLabel" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource FieldLabel}">
                            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2,0,6,0"/>
                        </Style>
                        <Style TargetType="ComboBox">
                            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="1"/>
                            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="4,1"/>
                        </Style>
                        <Style TargetType="TextBox">
                            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="1"/>
                            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2,1"/>
                            <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                            <!-- With a Chinese IME on, the "." of a decimal number would be typed as "。". -->
                            <Setter Property="InputMethod.IsInputMethodEnabled" Value="False"/>
                        </Style>
                        <!-- The hint in an empty number box, like the one of the search box; it follows the Text of its box through Tag. -->
                        <Style x:Key="EmptyHint" TargetType="TextBlock">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="Gray"/>
                            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="6,0,0,0"/>
                            <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                            <Setter Property="IsHitTestVisible" Value="False"/>
                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/>
                            <Style.Triggers>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Tag, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Self}}" Value="">
                                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                            </Style.Triggers>
                        </Style>
                    </Grid.Resources>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="120"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="120"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <TextBlock Text="Direction" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_direction" Grid.Column="1" AutomationProperties.Name="Direction"
                              SelectionChanged="property_SelectionChanged"/>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="3" Text="Wrap" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_wrap" Grid.Column="4" AutomationProperties.Name="Wrap"
                              SelectionChanged="property_SelectionChanged"/>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Text="JustifyContent" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_justifycontent" Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" AutomationProperties.Name="JustifyContent"
                              SelectionChanged="property_SelectionChanged"/>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="3" Text="AlignItems" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_alignitems" Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="4" AutomationProperties.Name="AlignItems"
                              SelectionChanged="property_SelectionChanged"/>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Text="AlignContent" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <ComboBox x:Name="combobox_aligncontent" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" AutomationProperties.Name="AlignContent"
                              SelectionChanged="property_SelectionChanged"/>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="3" Text="Gap" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <TextBox x:Name="textbox_gap" Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="4" AutomationProperties.Name="Gap"
                             ToolTip="Gap (px, 0 或以上): 項目之間的間距,也是 RowGap/ColumnGap 留空時的值"
                             TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Text="RowGap" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <Grid Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1">
                        <TextBox x:Name="textbox_rowgap" AutomationProperties.Name="RowGap"
                                 ToolTip="RowGap (px, 0 或以上): 上下方向的間距,留空表示使用 Gap"
                                 TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="同 Gap" Tag="{Binding Text, ElementName=textbox_rowgap}" Style="{StaticResource EmptyHint}"/>
                    </Grid>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="3" Text="ColumnGap" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}"/>
                    <Grid Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="4">
                        <TextBox x:Name="textbox_columngap" AutomationProperties.Name="ColumnGap"
                                 ToolTip="ColumnGap (px, 0 或以上): 左右方向的間距,留空表示使用 Gap"
                                 TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="同 Gap" Tag="{Binding Text, ElementName=textbox_columngap}" Style="{StaticResource EmptyHint}"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Text="Padding" Style="{StaticResource PropertyLabel}" ToolTip="Padding (px, 0 或以上): 由左至右依序為 左、上、右、下"/>
                    <UniformGrid Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="1" Columns="4">
                        <TextBox x:Name="textbox_padding_left" AutomationProperties.Name="Padding Left" ToolTip="Padding Left (px, 0 或以上)"
                                 TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>
                        <TextBox x:Name="textbox_padding_top" AutomationProperties.Name="Padding Top" ToolTip="Padding Top (px, 0 或以上)"
                                 TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>
                        <TextBox x:Name="textbox_padding_right" AutomationProperties.Name="Padding Right" ToolTip="Padding Right (px, 0 或以上)"
                                 TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>
                        <TextBox x:Name="textbox_padding_bottom" AutomationProperties.Name="Padding Bottom" ToolTip="Padding Bottom (px, 0 或以上)"
                                 TextChanged="property_TextChanged"/>
                    </UniformGrid>
                    <StackPanel Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="3" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <CheckBox x:Name="checkbox_scroll_horizontal" Content="水平捲軸" Margin="2,0,10,0"
                                  AutomationProperties.Name="水平捲軸" ToolTip="Parent.EnableHorizontalScrollbar"
                                  Checked="property_CheckedChanged" Unchecked="property_CheckedChanged"/>
                        <CheckBox x:Name="checkbox_scroll_vertical" Content="垂直捲軸"
                                  AutomationProperties.Name="垂直捲軸" ToolTip="Parent.EnableVerticalScrollbar"
                                  Checked="property_CheckedChanged" Unchecked="property_CheckedChanged"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <TextBox x:Name="textbox_content" Grid.Column="1" Height="136" Margin="2" Padding="4,2"
                         TextWrapping="Wrap" AcceptsReturn="True" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                         FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="12" Background="White"
                         AutomationProperties.Name="測試案例內容 (JSON，可編輯，不會寫回檔案)"
                         TextChanged="textbox_content_TextChanged"/>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>
        <!-- WebView2 is a child window that always sits on whole pixels, whereas WPF would place the ScrollViewer at
             a fractional position and size; rounding the layout makes the two panes (and their scrollbars) line up. -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="1" UseLayoutRounding="True">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                <ColumnDefinition/>
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <ScrollViewer x:Name="scrollviewer_flexpanel" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                <!-- The items keep the fractional positions the panel computes, which is what is compared with the CSS layout. -->
                <qpanel:FlexPanel x:Name="flexpanel" UseLayoutRounding="False"/>
            </ScrollViewer>
            <Grid Grid.Column="1">
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition/>
                    <RowDefinition/>
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <TextBlock TextAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Run Text="WPF"/><LineBreak/>
                    <Run Text="←"/>
                </TextBlock>
                <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" TextAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Run Text="Web"/><LineBreak/>
                    <Run Text="→"/>
                </TextBlock>
            </Grid>
            
            <webview:WebView2 x:Name="web" Grid.Column="2"/>
        </Grid>
        <!-- Reports each flex item's WPF vs. web-rendered (X, Y, Width, Height), populated by
             MainWindow.xaml.cs's ApplyTestCase/CompareAndShow after every test-case render.
             The list height is fixed so that emptying/refilling it never resizes the two panes above,
             which would leave the web page laid out in a viewport that no longer matches the WPF one. -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="4">
            <TextBlock x:Name="textblock_summary" FontWeight="Bold" Margin="0,2"/>
            <ListView x:Name="listview_comparison" Height="180">
                <ListView.View>
                    <GridView>
                        <GridViewColumn Header="#" Width="30" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding Index}"/>
                        <GridViewColumn Header="WPF (X, Y, W, H)" Width="200" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding WpfRect}"/>
                        <GridViewColumn Header="Web (X, Y, W, H)" Width="200" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding WebRect}"/>
                        <GridViewColumn Header="Diff (X, Y, W, H)" Width="180" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding DeltaRect}"/>
                        <GridViewColumn Header="結果" Width="80" DisplayMemberBinding="{Binding StatusText}"/>
                    </GridView>
                </ListView.View>
                <ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
                    <Style TargetType="ListViewItem">
                        <Style.Triggers>
                            <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsMatch}" Value="False">
                                <Setter Property="Background" Value="#FBD9D9"/>
                            </DataTrigger>
                            <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsMatch}" Value="True">
                                <Setter Property="Background" Value="#DCF3DC"/>
                            </DataTrigger>
                        </Style.Triggers>
                    </Style>
                </ListView.ItemContainerStyle>
            </ListView>
        </StackPanel>
    </Grid>
</Window>
